{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run, upgrade, repeat!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Running Out</i> is a fast-paced platformer where every second counts. Time is limited, but each run brings you closer to victory. Progress, upgrade your abilities, and optimize every move to go further and further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An addictive challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a race against the clock. Your first attempts will be short\u2014very short\u2014but every run unlocks upgrades that push your limits. More speed? Higher jumps? A dash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every choice shapes your progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pure adrenaline</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight and responsive platforming mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An addictive gameplay loop based on constant improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A challenge that rewards reflexes and optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A clean, readable style perfect for high-speed action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How far can you go before time runs out? \u23f3\ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511740?t=1741182577","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741182577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511740/b99171cd84cc63800c3a4d5a1a0ede7ccbdb2bba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741182577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511740/b99171cd84cc63800c3a4d5a1a0ede7ccbdb2bba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741182577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"des